cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "deorbit: low-velocity capture, aerobraking deorbit, and grazing-impact dynamics"
abstract: >-
  A research codebase for the capture and atmospheric deorbit of low-velocity
  Earth/Mars impactors and the resulting grazing impacts: a stdlib capture-corridor
  engine, a REBOUND/ASSIST high-fidelity validation layer, WGS84 site selection, a
  reduced-order grazing-impact model, and two validation-gated hydrocodes (an SPH
  solver and an Eulerian shock-physics cross-check) sharing one Tillotson EOS.
type: software
authors:
